    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block-000453-d47eaf8c",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[485]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 453,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Our cost structure has two components: cost of revenues and operating expenses. Our operating expenses include costs related to research and development, sales and marketing, and general and administrative functions. Certain of our costs and expenses, including those associated with the operation of our technical infrastructure as well as components of our operating expenses, are generally less variable in nature and may not correlate to changes in revenue. Additionally, fluctuations in employee compensation expenses may not directly correlate with changes in headcount, due to factors such as annual SBC awards that vest over time.",
        "text_hash": "d47eaf8c602e1d4bc29bfaaded287b9dca2d1348e2b263ba1a4552b43522245e",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000454-9198de8c",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[486]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 454,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-style": "italic",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Cost of Revenues",
        "text_hash": "9198de8cd537b11b7886a28c046bfa0648e80bee96ef95e8ecf2bd61f8b67a1f",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000455-1f857a8c",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[487]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 455,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Cost of revenues is comprised of TAC and other costs of revenues.",
        "text_hash": "1f857a8ca93c2bf89e01a8c194b400f77db40b206cdf819dc6fbb21b5c010112",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000456-6e5f85a7",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[488]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 456,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•TAC includes:",
        "text_hash": "6e5f85a76ea5223391fb666e899880dd85c2f51f836e4dd1c760fb64ba36e845",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000457-4105c03e",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[489]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 457,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "72pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "◦amounts paid to our distribution partners who make available our search access points and other ad-supported services. Our distribution partners include browser providers, mobile carriers, original equipment manufacturers, and software developers; and",
        "text_hash": "4105c03e2d26080e5336ea51d755fc716fb85cd8132a2321540b0003b58cc651",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000458-3320de4d",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[490]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 458,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "72pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "◦amounts paid to Google Network partners primarily for ads displayed on their properties.",
        "text_hash": "3320de4d720a17fe2cf00eca6f231c4be6d4e0c0a3ea968cec8c6a26d2a745c6",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000459-c8939698",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[491]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 459,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Other cost of revenues primarily includes:",
        "text_hash": "c893969886ec769f70bb3f8543cb7da51c9d26e933a8e4fa6940d398973d7d8e",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000460-4f5ad61b",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[492]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 460,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "72pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "◦content acquisition costs, which are payments to content providers from whom we license video and other content for distribution, primarily related to YouTube (we pay fees to these content providers based on revenues generated, subscriber counts, or a flat fee);",
        "text_hash": "4f5ad61b206e96958dc6578afbb1a9f829e608270916f34a6e32c205da25facc",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000461-fe9d35b5",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[493]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 461,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "72pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "◦depreciation expense, primarily related to our technical infrastructure;",
        "text_hash": "fe9d35b5b7c9988865fbff693895eac8e89f0139ce0e979919b3787729b40fa1",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000462-ef1bfb7a",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[494]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 462,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "72pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "◦employee compensation expenses related to our technical infrastructure and other operations such as content review and customer and product support;",
        "text_hash": "ef1bfb7aee0522761ac8967c00e4b759698b78265dd3dc0730091e1712919046",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000463-285a5355",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[495]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 463,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "72pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "◦inventory and other costs related to the devices we sell; and",
        "text_hash": "285a5355e17bffcd4076bfa3ad45a4f965e933eedb1ebaa8268f9ca9f85f5a4d",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000464-9a32ea8e",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[496]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 464,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "72pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "◦other technical infrastructure operations costs, including energy, equipment, and network capacity costs.",
        "text_hash": "9a32ea8ea167378d6d88acee40a85dcd43b203e52a3a469cb6f3db0ce77be7de",
        "type": "paragraph"
      }
    ],
